  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GMAP3 UNMAS Sudan MoU Component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MoU between FCDO and UNMAS (value GBP 800,000) arranging for delivery of Explosive Ordnance Risk Education (EORE) for civilians and humanitarian workers in Sudan as well as coordination of the mine action sector, maintenance of IMSMA (Information Management System for Mine Action) and support to the establishment of the national mine action sector in Sudan.</narrative>
  </description>
